Third-party data (NOT covered by the MIT licence above, downloaded at run time):
* UCI SMS Spam Collection - CC BY 4.0 - Almeida, Hidalgo & Yamakami (2011)
* SMS Phishing Dataset for ML and Pattern Recognition - CC BY 4.0 - Mishra & Soni (2022)
  https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/f45bkkt8pr/1
Changes made: PII masking, label mapping (smishing -> phishing), de-duplication, splitting.
Pre-trained model: sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2 (Apache-2.0).
